  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gabon Second Fiscal Consolidation and Inclusive Growth DPF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Second Gabon Fiscal Consolidation and Inclusive Growth Development Policy Financing Project of Gabon is to continue to support spending efficiency and inclusive growth. This development policy loan will continue to support the government&apos;s effects in: (i) strengthening fiscal sustainability and efficiency in public sector management; (ii) enhancing competitiveness; and (iii) protecting the poor. The overall risk of this operation is high, but if successful, it will align with the World Bank&apos;s twin goals of ending extreme poverty and promoting shared prosperity as well as with more specific engagement on these topics in Gabon.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This second operation maintains the development objectives of the first operation and continues to support spending efficiency and inclusive growth. It will continue to support Government&apos;s efforts in: (i) strengthening fiscal sustainability and efficiency in public sector management; (ii) enhancing competitiveness; and (iii) protecting the poor.</narrative>
  </description>
